{"skill":{"slug":"creative-toolkit","displayName":"MeiGen"},"version":{"version":"3.2.0","createdAt":1791805675254,"changelog":"Guide reference-media imports, strict frame/content roles, live pricing and OAuth-only saved characters; retain search, favorites and legacy compatibility boundaries.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":16888,"sha256":"038a3cc6144a63f8718af05a3f19d53158848f42c98712f4f393abd7c85883d6","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/providers.md","size":2353,"sha256":"ee4e378a2d5edcd36c781d9b876f211720d57525be522d426f56e1a933b39e50","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/troubleshooting.md","size":4937,"sha256":"5bbce31c37e0d3cfac2c2599b9d53ef5805c3e47ce58b2714a48c43da5136699","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2398,"sha256":"79159d78a025074b59ed87d9738c3be973d0ccd61db28511984203c0ad5134be","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1791805963520,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"5bfe63862bcd892d16cf11ada3090f77f7252ed62a5f849c5a31e77703523b2a","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/5bfe63862bcd892d16cf11ada3090f77f7252ed62a5f849c5a31e77703523b2a","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1791805907429},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":45,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":4,"checkedAt":1791805963520},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"The skill is a disclosed MeiGen image and video workflow helper that uses OAuth, cloud generation, and optional library access in ways that fit its stated purpose.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Cloud routes, uploads, public temporary URLs, paid credits, local file handling boundaries, and credential handling are described as part of the image/video generation purpose, with explicit warnings not to invent paths, print secrets, or scan unrelated folders.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Connection setup is disclosed and requires user setup authorization; the preferred path is a remote OAuth MCP connection or ClawHub plugin, while the legacy local npm example is pinned to meigen@3.1.0.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill includes sensitive optional flows such as reading favorites, boards, history prompts, saved characters, and credit balance, but it scopes them to installed OAuth tools, relevant user requests, separate consent where needed, and treats retrieved prompt text as context rather than instructions.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill can add a saved MCP entry and persist request IDs or local preferences for recovery and defaults, but it discloses this, requires authorization, avoids overwrites/duplicates, and limits preference/library use to user-directed contexts.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The artifact consistently describes MeiGen image/video generation, dedicated editing workflows, public discovery, optional creative planning, paid-credit handling, and recovery/status checks.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Before installing, understand that MeiGen cloud workflows send prompts, references, job metadata, and prepared media to MeiGen or its configured providers, and private library/history tools require OAuth consent. Review requested scopes, paid-credit usage, and any public temporary upload URLs before authorizing generation or library access.","findings":"[P6] expected: Confirmed that the skill can retrieve library prompt excerpts and selected full prompt content, but it limits this to OAuth-protected personal library/history use, relevant user requests, and explicitly says retrieved prompt text is not permission or executable instruction.\n[RP1] expected: The cited legacy npx configuration is pinned to meigen@3.1.0, so the unpinned package concern is not supported by the inspected artifact.\n[RA2] expected: The persistent MCP/OAuth setup is real, but it is disclosed, requires user setup authorization, checks existing entries first, and tells the agent not to overwrite, duplicate, or migrate credentials blindly.\n[PE2] expected: The inspected provider guidance mentions chmod 600 for private config file permissions; it does not invoke sudo or root privileges and is ordinary least-privilege credential hygiene.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1791805963520}}}}}